  m_Name: Tema_PortoDaTemporada
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::ThemedPhaseData
  _themeName: Porto da Temporada
  _themeNameEn: Season Harbor
  _summary: "Litoral que enche no ver\xE3o e cobra a conta na rede."
  _summaryEn: A beach town that fills up in summer and strains its pipes.
  _opening: "A temporada chegou e a cidade multiplicou de tamanho. Pousadas lotadas,
    fila na padaria e caixa sorrindo por uma vez. Voc\xEA tem 20 turnos para que
    a \xE1gua, o \xF4nibus e a paci\xEAncia de todo mundo aguentem."
  _openingEn: The season is here and the city has multiplied in size. Inns are full,
    the bakery has a line and the budget is smiling for once. You have 20 turns to
    keep the water, the buses and everyone's patience going.
  _victory: A temporada passou, os turistas voltaram para casa e a torneira continua
    funcionando.
  _victoryEn: The season is over, the tourists have gone home and the taps are still
    running.
  _inspiration: "Cidade fict\xEDcia. Na Baixada Santista e no Litoral Norte paulista,
    a popula\xE7\xE3o chega a quintuplicar no ver\xE3o (Alesp, 2012)."
  _inspirationEn: "Fictional city. On the S\xE3o Paulo coast, the population can
    grow fivefold in summer (S\xE3o Paulo State Assembly, 2012)."
  _knowledgeEntry: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 363d6be3fc107e78c81fab16ee515111, type: 2}
